7
00:00:47,729 --> 00:00:50,633
Terrific mood all over Olympic Park.

8
00:00:52,715 --> 00:00:58,000
This evening, as two amazing weeks starts to reach its conclusion,

9
00:01:01,523 --> 00:01:03,908
Get ready to hear those home supporters.

10
00:01:04,528 --> 00:01:05,790
Here is Tom Daley.

11
00:01:11,903 --> 00:01:18,837
It's been a great game for Great Britain, but this young man, just 18 years of age, carries so many hopes on his young shoulders.

12
00:01:19,659 --> 00:01:22,704
He's got his fan club out in force tonight.

13
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:32,843
Well, will he be inhibited or will he be inspired?

14
00:01:32,903 --> 00:01:37,667
